<view class="page search-page"><view class="eyebrow">标题、原文与出处都能搜</view><view class="page-title">搜一个生活问题</view><view class="search-box"><view class="search-glyph"></view><input value="{{query}}" bindinput="input" bindconfirm="run" maxlength="80" confirm-type="search" placeholder="搜标题、原文或出处" placeholder-style="color:#807063"/><button wx:if="{{query}}" bindtap="clear" class="search-clear">清除</button></view>
 <view wx:if="{{!searchedQuery}}" class="search-start"><view class="section-title">从一个问题开始</view><view class="hot-grid"><button wx:for="{{hot}}" wx:key="*this" bindtap="hot" data-q="{{item}}">{{item}} <text>↗</text></button></view><view class="search-tip">搜索覆盖建议原文、适用条件与出处。<text>{{"\n"}}</text>多个关键词用空格隔开，可以缩小范围。</view></view>
 <view wx:else><view class="search-count">找到 {{total}} 条与「{{searchedQuery}}」有关的建议</view><entry-card class="entry-host" wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="id" entry="{{item}}"/><view wx:if="{{!total}}" class="empty"><view class="empty-symbol">⌕</view><view class="empty-title">这次没找到</view><view class="empty-note">试试更短的关键词，比如“睡眠”或“租房”。</view><button class="secondary-button" bindtap="clear">换个词再找</button></view><button wx:if="{{hasMore}}" class="secondary-button" bindtap="more">再看 20 条 ↓</button><view wx:elif="{{total}}" class="bottom-note">已经到底了 · 共 {{total}} 条</view></view>
</view>
